-- It ADDS three functions (two internal trigger functions and the read-only _order_commitment), nine triggers on orders,
-- order_lines, shipments and events, and twelve restrictive access rules; and REVOKES write privileges on orders (insert,
-- delete, truncate), order_lines, shipments, events, wms_picks (all writes) and returns (delete, truncate) from the public key
-- and signed-in logins. It replaces no function, changes no existing access rule and no row, leaves SELECT and the service
-- login's privileges as they are, and contains no DROP. Needs dev_035 (wms_demo_brand).
